# Firebender Ascension: "you may copy that ability. You may choose new targets for the copy." (CR 707.10, 707.10c) Turn 1 Bot1 casts
# the Ascension (its Soldier token), Flesh Burrower and Memnite. Turn 3 the Burrower and the Soldier attack (two quest counters; the
# Burrower's trigger targets Memnite) and turn 5 the Burrower attacks alone (the third). Turn 7 the Burrower's trigger caused the fourth
# counter: Bot1 copies it and gives the copy a new target, Ornithopter. Memnite has deathtouch from the original, and Ornithopter
# (cast on turn 3, still summoning sick but a legal target) from the copy.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mountain
Firebender Ascension
Flesh Burrower
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

